From 878f55a85847dc285cc5576d26dac70707c35974 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pardha Kesapragada <pkesapragada@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 01 Feb 2021 20:22:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-20154] rsa: support for pkcs#1 v 1.5 decryption

This patch adds support for pkcs#1 v1.5 decryption
from Uboot master version 2020.10.
Instead of computing the public key properties (or)
extracting them from a fit file, this decryption
expects the properties of public key to be appended
to the end of public key.

Change-Id: I2ff7b290a6038eb0f95b9861e280560be1b1ca11
Signed-off-by: Pardha Kesapragada <pkesapragada@habana.ai>
---

